==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Brollow]] spawns.
**8 [[Brollow]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Calamary]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Spam Area Attackers and meatshields.

